{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Well-kneaded.</b> Boiled thoroughly — all it needs (ibid.)." "<b>Baked.</b> Baked in many bakings — after its boiling he bakes it in the oven and then fries it in a pan (Menachot 50a)." "<b>A meal-offering of fine pieces.</b> This teaches that it requires fine breaking-up."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:13.874892233Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}